#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:2
msgid "引言：图像分割问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:4
msgid "从分类到分割：问题升级"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`../cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics` 中我们学的 CNN "
"擅长做**图像分类**：输入一张 28×28 的手写数字，输出\"这是 "
"3\"。关键在于，分类只需要回答\"整体是什么\"——即使你只看到数字的一小部分，也能猜出来。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:8
msgid "但现实中有很多问题需要 **\"每个点是什么\"**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:10
msgid "**医学影像**：CT 图像中每个像素是肿瘤还是正常组织？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:11
msgid "**自动驾驶**：每个像素是道路、行人、还是天空？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:12
msgid "**卫星图像**：每个像素是农田、建筑、还是水域？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:14
msgid ""
"这就是**图像分割（Image Segmentation）**——对每个像素分配一个类别标签。一张 256×256 的图像有 65,536 "
"个像素，每个都需要预测。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:16
msgid "学习目标"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:19
msgid "完成本章后，你将能够："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:20
msgid "**理解分割任务**：图像分割是什么、为什么比分类更难、和 CNN 的关联"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:21
msgid "**掌握 U-Net 架构**：U 形结构、编码器-解码器、跳跃连接的直觉和原理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:22
msgid "**理解跳跃连接的价值**：为什么\"抄近道\"能同时保留位置和语义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:23
msgid "**能够实现 U-Net**：从核心组件到完整模型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:24
msgid "**了解损失函数**：Dice 损失为什么比交叉熵更适合分割任务"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:27
msgid "分类 vs 分割的直觉"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:30
msgid "**分类**像考试判断题：\"这张图里有猫吗？\"——看一眼就能答。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:32
msgid "**分割**像做填色游戏：你需要精确地沿着猫的轮廓涂色，一根胡须都不能漏。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:34
msgid "后者需要**同时**知道两件事："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:35
msgid "**\"这是什么\"**（语义理解）：那是猫，不是狗"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:36
msgid "**\"它在哪\"**（空间精度）：猫的边界到第 237 行 189 列"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:39
msgid "为什么分类网络不能直接用来做分割？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:41
msgid "直觉上，你可能想把全连接层换成\"每个像素一个分类器\"。但这里有一个根本矛盾："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`../cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics` 中我们学了 CNN "
"的编码过程：卷积+池化逐步**下采样**，空间尺寸从 28×28 缩小到 "
"1×1。这是分类成功的关键——**丢掉位置信息，提炼语义信息**（{ref}`receptive-field` "
"告诉我们，深层神经元看的区域大，能理解整体）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:45
msgid "但分割需要**同时保留**位置和语义。下采样丢了位置，直接去不掉。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:55
msgid "这就引出了核心问题：**如何把缩小的特征图恢复回原始分辨率，同时不丢失细节？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:57
msgid "U-Net 的回答：编码器-解码器 + 跳跃连接"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid "U-Net {cite}`ronneberger2015u` 的答案今天看来简单而优雅："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:61
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**编码器（Encoder）**：就是标准的 CNN，逐步下采样提取语义——跟你学的 LeNet-5（{doc}`../cnn-"
"expedition/practice-peak/le-net`）前半部分一样"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:62
msgid "**解码器（Decoder）**：对称的上采样路径，逐步恢复空间分辨率"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:63
msgid "**跳跃连接（Skip Connection）**：把编码器每一层的特征直接\"抄近道\"送到对应层的解码器"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:66
msgid "U 形架构概念图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:109
#, python-brace-format
msgid "右边和左边是对称的，中间是跳跃连接——形成了 U 形。{ref}`unet-arch` 中有更详细的架构 mermaid 图。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:111
msgid "直觉：为什么 U 形能解决\"位置 vs 语义\"的矛盾？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:113
msgid "你在做一个\"从缩略图还原高清图\"的任务："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:115
msgid "**缩略图**虽然模糊，但告诉了你\"整体是个什么东西\"（语义）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:116
msgid "你手边有一叠**原始高清图的局部截图**（编码器每层的特征）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:117
msgid "**最好的办法**：看着缩略图知道整体形状，再参考每张局部截图还原细节"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:119
msgid "编码器各层的特征图就是那些\"局部截图\"——浅层保留精确位置，深层提炼抽象语义。跳跃连接把它们直接送到解码器对应层，让解码器**同时拥有**位置和语义。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:121
#, python-brace-format
msgid "与 {ref}`receptive-field` 中讨论的感受野递推类似，U-Net 每层特征图的感受野不同："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:123
msgid "浅层：小感受野，知道\"边缘在哪个像素\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:124
msgid "深层：大感受野，知道\"这是肿瘤还是正常组织\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:125
msgid "跳跃连接：**同时给小感受野和大感受野的信息**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:127
msgid "U-Net 的历史意义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:129
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"U-Net 由 Olaf Ronneberger 等人在 2015 年提出 "
"{cite}`ronneberger2015u`，初衷是生物医学图像分割。它的关键贡献不是发明了新东西（卷积、池化、跳跃连接都是现成的），而是**把这些组件组合成了一个优雅的对称结构**，恰好解决了分割问题的核心矛盾。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:131
msgid ""
"在当年的 ISBI 细胞分割挑战赛上，U-Net 用 **30 张训练图像**就达到了超越所有传统方法的效果——Dice 系数 0.775 vs "
"第二名 0.460。这在深度学习以\"大数据\"为王的年代，显得格外引人注目。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:133
msgid "与 FCN 的关键区别"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:136
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在 U-Net 之前，全卷积网络（FCN）{cite}`long2015learning` 已经尝试用 CNN 做分割。但 FCN "
"的上采样只用一次双线性插值，跳跃连接也只是简单相加。U-Net 做了两个关键改进："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:145
msgid "本章路线"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/introduction.md:157
#, python-brace-format
msgid "下一节 {doc}`u-net` 我们深入 U 形架构的内部，看编码器、解码器和跳跃连接是如何协同工作的。"
msgstr ""

